    {
      "source": "As with standard <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a> classes, the order in which\nauto-configuration classes are applied only affects the order in which their beans are\ndefined. The order in which those beans are subsequently created is unaffected and is\ndetermined by each bean's dependencies and any <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/DependsOn.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@DependsOn</code></a>\nrelationships.",
